catflow 0.8
1. Read Text           draft.md
2. Read Text           style-guide.md

3. Rewrite     (1,2)   Qwen3 8B; "Rewrite [1] to follow the style guide
                       [2]. Change tone and wording, never facts."
4. Diff        (1,3)   format=inline
5. Save Text   (3)     draft-styled.md
6. Save Text   (4)     what-changed.diff
